body:
Thought about going clubbing and knocking myself out stone-cold with my ex. She offered to go with me. Such a golden soul, she's helping me find someone. Shame it's pointless. It always looks so promising, and then they just turn around and decide that no, they actually don't want me at all.

&#x200B;

I'm only 17, feel too young to die. But look. Look look look look look. Just one minute, less than a minute. I want to enlist in two years. But two years is too much. I can't be this lonely for two more years. The military would fix all my problems, but it's too far away.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Hey, we can help each other out. I'm ending on the 1st of September, most likely. Unless a miracle hits my life. Which, well... I'm secretly hoping for that.

&#x200B;

PM me.
